cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Tengoku, please cite the version you used (release vX.Y.Z) and the commit its snapshot.json names."
type: dataset
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23050400
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.23050400
    description: "Every version (resolves to the newest); each release also has its own DOI"
title: "Tengoku: one verified Lean 4 tree of formal mathematics, with provenance"
abstract: >-
  Tengoku gathers theorems from many formal mathematics libraries into one Lean 4 tree on a single pinned
  toolchain. A theorem is trusted only once the tree builds with it and it uses no sorry and only the standard
  axioms; every record carries a link to its source at a fixed commit, its licence, and its credit. Monthly
  snapshots publish the dataset with a manifest and build provenance.
authors:
  - name: "Tengoku contributors"
  - family-names: "Bashir"
    given-names: "Mikael"
repository-code: "https://github.com/competemath/tengoku"
url: "https://competemath.com/tengoku"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formal mathematics
  - theorem proving
  - provenance
